BT 1 0 0 1 0 34.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (This declaration creates a continuously driven connection. Whenever the lower half of a changes, aLower) Tj T* (follows it. The equals sign here belongs to a net declaration assignment; it does not mean an assignment) Tj T* (executed once at startup.) Tj T* ET
