0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (Changing only wire to reg changes the meaning of the declaration: a variable declaration initializer is a) Tj T* (startup initialization, not a continuously tracking expression. If a changes later, the initializer does not) Tj T* (execute again. An initially unknown input can also leave that variable unknown. The signal needs either a) Tj T* (net connection or an explicit procedural assignment that runs when the inputs change.) Tj T* ET
