BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F1 10.5 Tf 15 TL (This alternative describes combinational logic because every execution assigns aLower and the sensitivity) Tj T* (covers the expression inputs. The keyword reg itself does not demand a physical register. In this particular) Tj T* (adder, the wire form is simpler: no clock or storage is required. You can also connect the input slice directly) Tj T* (to the instance port.) Tj T* ET
